==Russian==

===Alternative forms===
* {{l|ru|недѣ́ля}} {{ru-PRO}}

===Etymology===
From {{inh|ru|orv|недѣлꙗ||Sunday}}, equivalent to {{l|ru|не}} + {{m|ru|делать|де́лая|no working}}, originally used to mean [[Sunday]], the day of rest (Old Church Slavonic {{m|cu|недѣлꙗ|sc=Cyrs||not doing}}).

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|неде́ля}}
* {{audio|Ru-неделя.ogg|Audio|lang=ru}}

===Noun===
{{ru-noun+|неде́ля}}

# [[week]]
#: {{uxi|ru|[[в]] '''неде́лю'''|per week}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[на]] [[прошлый|про́шлой]] '''неде́ле'''|last week}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[на]] [[этот|э́той]] '''неде́ле'''|this week}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[на]] [[будущий|бу́дущей]] '''неде́ле'''|next week}}
# {{lb|ru|archaic}} [[Sunday]]

